    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Arrays</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Prefix sum + hash map</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/subarray-sum-equals-k/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 560</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Subarray Sum Equals K</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A subarray sum is a difference of two prefix sums, so walk once, and at each running sum add how many earlier prefixes equal run - k (seed the map with 0 : 1). Negatives rule out a sliding window. O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
